ght, it\u2019s a fight.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/1c252c737f35120562ef6a303802aa0e.poster.avif?t=1768953144\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/1c252c737f35120562ef6a303802aa0e.webm?t=1768953144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/1c252c737f35120562ef6a303802aa0e.mp4?t=1768953144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stars End</i> is a player-hosted/solo sci-fi survival sandbox set hundreds of years in the future, in a star system colonized by humans escaping a dying Earth. What was meant to be a second chance has become a lawless frontier \u2014 a place where every scrap, bullet, and building must be earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out here, you\u2019ll wrangle resources from dangerous planets, fend off alien wildlife (watch out for bears), and build your own base \u2014 be it a frontier shack or a fortified space station. Explore procedurally generated worlds on foot, horseback, or by starship, then blast into orbit and continue the fight in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/441c4ec960fd9556a613a4bfe75a51bb.poster.avif?t=1768953144\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/441c4ec960fd9556a613a4bfe75a51bb.webm?t=1768953144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/441c4ec960fd9556a613a4bfe75a51bb.mp4?t=1768953144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video