ip.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/7daab4d1fc6d409bef8eba65564f2146.poster.avif?t=1768953144\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/7daab4d1fc6d409bef8eba65564f2146.webm?t=1768953144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/extras/7daab4d1fc6d409bef8eba65564f2146.mp4?t=1768953144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Player-Hosted Servers</strong> \u2013 Play alone, with friends, or open your world to others via custom servers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Open World</strong> \u2013 Build, explore, and take on story-driven missions across procedurally generated planets in a\u00a0 sci-fi sandbox.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Reverie World Studios"],"dlc":[2287320],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623340/ac01f5715d07e21c1f227b32c434c37a6bddc613/header.jpg?t=1768953144","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2018-2023 Reverie World Studios, Inc. and Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nReverie World Studios, Stars End Online and their respective logos are trademarks of Reverie World Studios, Inc. The ratings icon is a trademark of the Entertainment Software Association. All other marks are property of their respective owners. The content of this videogame is fictional and is not intended to represent or depict an actual record of the events